{"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "schema", "document", "Document"], "kwargs": {"metadata": {"thread_id": "2509463_2509461", "turn_ids": ["2509463_2509461", "2509462_2509464", "2509465_2509466"], "root_turns": ["2509463_2509461"]}, "page_content": "Customer: text: Hey @SpotifyCares I have a Q: while I love the Daily Mix feature, is there a way to get it to stop playing the same songs over and over? You've got the whole of music to choose from, and my tastes are pretty catholic! I know this is a pretty basic Q but I never tweet at companies\nAgent: text: @715366 Hi Jonny! Daily Mix serves up unique mixes based on aspects of your music taste. You\u2019ll mainly hear tunes you already love and familiar with. If you'd like to hear something fresh that's also tailored for you, check out Discover Weekly and Release Radar \ud83c\udfb6 /RR\n  Customer: text: @SpotifyCares Can I customize a mix of all three?\n  Agent: text: @715366 Just to clarify, are you trying to make a new playlist containing similar tracks from your Discover Weekly, Release Radar, and Daily Mix playlists? /RR\n    Customer: text: @SpotifyCares Yes, I love the idea of a curated playlist containing both new and familiar artists. I'd like to see more of a variety of tracks from the selected artists too. It's as the algorithm thinks there's only one Fela Kuti song worth hearing!\n    Agent: text: @715366 We understand you'd like to get more variety in your Discover Weekly, Release Radar, and Daily Mix playlists. Keep listening to your favorite tunes. This will help mix things up. But thanks for the feedback \u2013 we appreciate it! We\u2019ll get this passed onto the right team \ud83d\udc9a /AP", "type": "Document"}}